# Articles

Apply when editing **reader-facing articles** (essays under topic folders, `blog/*.md`). **Not** investigations, `page.md` indices, or dossiers unless asked.

**Full canon:** [`docs/instructions/ARTICLES.md`](../../docs/instructions/ARTICLES.md)

## Compact

- Links and images: **`https://paradigmthreat.net/...`** (absolute).
- Voice: **chronicle / documentary** — who did what, in order; **`I`** only for personal witness; no poetry, no manifesto cadence, no “this essay argues.” The reader decides; the page supplies the facts.
- Prefer Ari’s spoken wording from chat; do not upgrade it into verse. Same bar for comment replies: [plain-spoken prose](plain-spoken-prose.mdc).
- Proof density and **Limits** live in **`investigations/`** dossiers — articles summarize and link.
- Prefer cross-linking other **articles**; link dossiers only as companion receipts.
- Run **`npm run autogen`** after substantive edits.
- Tone model when narrating: [`governance/war/the-great-depression-was-planned.md`](../../governance/war/the-great-depression-was-planned.md).
